# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   — imperative, lower case, no period, ≤72 chars
#
# <body>   — what & why, wrapped at 72 columns
#
# <footer>   — BREAKING CHANGE: …, refs, Co-Authored-By:
#
# type:  feat fix perf refactor docs style test build ci chore revert
# scope: editor preview export workspace settings engine ui core
# Append ! after type/scope for a breaking change, e.g. feat(export)!:
